# Repo snapshots — redundant with git history (each snapshot == a full source tree
# already reachable by commit sha). Removed from tracking v0.62.508; recover any past
# snapshot via `git show <sha>:vault/<version>/<path>`. Kept ignored so ad-hoc local
# snapshots are never re-committed.
vault/

# v0.62.860 — Wrong-Log. NOT committed, by operator instruction: `ang-kl/gia` is a
# public repo and `data/session-replies.ndjson` is already in it, so committing this
# would publish 226 paragraphs of defect narrative on GitHub regardless of the
# soleat.net gate. The durable half is the SCRIPT (extract-wrong-log.mjs), which
# carries no paragraphs. Consequence, stated in that script's header too: Railway
# deploys from git, so a gitignored file can never reach /doc/vibe-journal.html.
doc/VibeCodingRecord/data/wrong-log.ndjson
doc/VibeCodingRecord/data/wrong-log.stats.json
doc/VibeCodingRecord/wrong-log.html
